WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
What kind of skills do you have in performing calculations in the dark?

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,680
Do you dare to come down and swim around for a while?

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,800
What am I afraid of?

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,640
My body is full of tranquility and running around all day long

5
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:08,000
The physical body has long been blurred by cold and heat

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,480
Even if you go swimming in a polar ice cave

7
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:15,590
I can't get any reward, it's okay, it's cold

8
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:16,790
I've warned you a long time ago

9
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:18,310
Hurry up and get the deposit approved.

10
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:20,600
It's a bit cold indeed

11
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,720
Fortunately you prepared hot drinks in advance

12
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,800
Keep warm first

13
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,720
Don't make fun of your body

14
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,160
I'm going to change clothes first

15
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,400
thank you just now

16
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:36,580
Outdoor activities in the future

17
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:39,700
The safety plan needs to be more detailed

18
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,700
This opening dance has a good rhythm

19
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,300
But tighten your movements a little more

20
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,860
You will understand if it is more suitable for formal burial.

21
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:47,420
This version will be given to the boss for acceptance first.

22
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:49,980
After modification, hand it over to the activity team for rehearsal

23
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,220
Work is work
